WiFi firmware for the Broadcom/Cypress CYW43455 (BCM4345) FullMAC SDIO chip,
as fitted to the Raspberry Pi 5. Installed to
\SystemRoot\system32\drivers\brcm\ and loaded by the cyw43455 driver during
chip bring-up.

